      "subject": "[SPI Checking] UITextEffectView swift SPI is different on debug/release configurations https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=297800 rdar://158963964",
      "description": "Reviewed by Richard Robinson.\n\nThis appears to be some detail of the Swift ABI that binds to different\nsymbols (such as a class's __allocation_init vs __init) at different\noptimization levels. Reflect this in WebKit's allowlist.\n\n* Source/WebKit/Configurations/AllowedSPI-legacy.toml:\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/299169@main",
      "github_url": "https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/677fa6dd436b7e0cfadf8ee3c52d64abb5c369cd",
