      "feature_area": "SPI Tooling & Allowlist Baseline",
      "why_changed": "Migrates Swift SPI allowlist entries from fragile mangled symbol strings to clean demangled swift-decls in AllowedSPI.toml and AllowedSPI-legacy.toml.",
      "legacy_addition_category": "tooling-disambiguation-or-swift-mangling",
      "legacy_addition_reason": "Replaced 65 mangled Swift `symbols` (35 `UIKit.UITextEffectView*` + 30 `UIIntelligenceSupport*`) in `WebKit/Configurations/AllowedSPI-legacy.toml` with 42 demangled `swift-decls` entries.",
