      "author": "Alex Christensen",
      "subject": "Update signature of SecQWACTLSBindingVerify https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=324285 rdar://187513165",
      "description": "Reviewed by Ben Nham.\n\nAs part of the review of rdar://187496225 we need to update the signature of the function.\nTo prevent build breakage, we use a new definition included in the Security framework headers.\nThis will be added to Security.framework in rdar://187125588\n\n* Source/WTF/wtf/spi/cocoa/SecuritySPI.h:\n* Source/WebKit/NetworkProcess/QualifiedServerTrustFetch.cpp:\n(WebKit::QualifiedServerTrustFetch::didFinishLoading):\n* Source/WebKit/NetworkProcess/cocoa/SecuritySoftLink.h:\n* Source/WebKit/NetworkProcess/cocoa/SecuritySoftLink.mm:\n* Source/WebKit/Configurations/AllowedSPI.toml:\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/321253@main",
      "github_url": "https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/d07436ebd417b5a10813be281035336ea1a3be17",
      "bugs": [
        "https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=324285",
        "rdar://187125588",
        "rdar://187496225",
        "rdar://187513165"
      ],
      "primary_category": "build-or-conditional-fix",
      "feature_area": "Authentication, Passkeys & Security",
      "why_changed": "Guards SecQWACTLSBindingVerify in AllowedSPI.toml with SEC_TRUST_HAS_QWAC_BINDING_VERIFY to handle upstream signature updates without breaking builds.",
      "legacy_addition_category": null,
      "legacy_addition_reason": null,
      "touched_toml_files": [
        "Source/WebKit/Configurations/AllowedSPI.toml"
      ],
      "other_touched_files_count": 4,
