      "legacy_addition_reason": "Added 5 `UIIntelligenceSupport` Swift declarations (`ExportableData`, `exportableData`, `ContextMenuInvocation.exportableData`, `contextMenuInvocation`, `remoteContext`) directly to `WebKit/Configurations/AllowedSPI-legacy.toml` for Siri AI long-press image queries in `WKWebView`.",
