      "subject": "Block requests with a WebPrivacy provided content rule list instead of a network process check rdar://187822866 https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=324589",
      "description": "Reviewed by Wenson Hsieh.\n\nThis patch replaces the static domain list in the network process with a content rule list that\nWebPrivacy provides.\n\nThe UI process loads the list through a new `TrackingPreventionContentRuleListController` the first\ntime a page with the setting enabled starts using a data store. It caches the list, sends it to the\nnetwork process, and reloads it when WebPrivacy posts an update. `shouldBlockForTrackingPolicy()`\nthen checks each non-main-frame, cross-site request against this list using a new\n`shouldBlockLoad()`.\n\n`ResourceMonitorURLsController`'s request-coalescing logic moves into a shared\n`WebPrivacyContentRuleListController` template, and the new controller reuses it.\n\nTest: Tools/TestWebKitAPI/Tests/WebKit/WKWebView/ScriptTrackingPrivacyTests.mm\n\n* Source/WebCore/PAL/pal/spi/cocoa/WebPrivacySPI.h:\n* Source/WebCore/contentextensions/ContentExtensionsBackend.cpp:\n(WebCore::ContentExtensions::ContentExtensionsBackend::processContentRuleListsForLoad const):\n(WebCore::ContentExtensions::ContentExtensionsBackend::shouldBlockLoad const):\n(WebCore::ContentExtensions::ContentExtensionsBackend::processContentRuleListsForResourceMonitoring):\n* Source/WebCore/contentextensions/ContentExtensionsBackend.h:\n* Source/WebCore/loader/ResourceLoadInfo.h:\n* Source/WebKit/Configurations/AllowedSPI.toml:\n* Source/WebKit/NetworkProcess/NetworkContentRuleListManager.cpp:\n(WebKit::NetworkContentRuleListManager::setTrackingPreventionContentRuleList):\n* Source/WebKit/NetworkProcess/NetworkContentRuleListManager.h:\n* Source/WebKit/NetworkProcess/NetworkLoadChecker.cpp:\n(WebKit::contentExtensionResourceType):\n(WebKit::NetworkLoadChecker::shouldBlockForTrackingPolicy):\n* Source/WebKit/NetworkProcess/NetworkLoadChecker.h:\n* Source/WebKit/NetworkProcess/NetworkProcess.cpp:\n(WebKit::NetworkProcess::setTrackingPreventionContentRuleList):\n* Source/WebKit/NetworkProcess/NetworkProcess.h:\n* Source/WebKit/NetworkProcess/NetworkProcess.messages.in:\n* Source/WebKit/NetworkProcess/NetworkResourceLoadParameters.h:\n* Source/WebKit/NetworkProcess/NetworkResourceLoadParameters.serialization.in:\n* Source/WebKit/NetworkProcess/NetworkSession.cpp:\n(WebKit::NetworkSession::isRequestBlockable): Deleted.\n* Source/WebKit/NetworkProcess/NetworkSession.h:\n* Source/WebKit/Platform/cocoa/WebPrivacyHelpers.h:\n(WebKit::WebPrivacyContentRuleListController::prepare):\n* Source/WebKit/Platform/cocoa/WebPrivacyHelpers.mm:\n(WebKit::ResourceMonitorURLsController::canRequestContentRuleList const):\n(WebKit::ResourceMonitorURLsController::requestContentRuleList):\n(WebKit::TrackingPreventionContentRuleListController::singleton):\n(WebKit::TrackingPreventionContentRuleListController::resourceTypeValue const):\n(WebKit::TrackingPreventionContentRuleListController::canRequestContentRuleList const):\n(WebKit::TrackingPreventionContentRuleListController::requestContentRuleList):\n(WebKit::isRequestToKnownCrossSiteTracker):\n(WebKit::ResourceMonitorURLsController::prepare): Deleted.\n(WebKit::isRequestBlockable): Deleted.\n* Source/WebKit/UIProcess/API/Cocoa/WKContentRuleList.mm:\n(WebKit::createCompiledContentRuleList):\n* Source/WebKit/UIProcess/API/Cocoa/WKContentRuleListInternal.h:\n* Source/WebKit/UIProcess/Cocoa/WebProcessPoolCocoa.mm:\n(WebKit::createCompiledContentRuleList): Deleted.\n* Source/WebKit/UIProcess/Network/NetworkProcessProxy.cpp:\n(WebKit::cachedTrackingPreventionContentRuleList):\n(WebKit::NetworkProcessProxy::NetworkProcessProxy):\n(WebKit::NetworkProcessProxy::requestTrackingPreventionContentRuleList):\n(WebKit::NetworkProcessProxy::loadTrackingPreventionContentRuleList):\n(WebKit::NetworkProcessProxy::setTrackingPreventionContentRuleList):\n(WebKit::NetworkProcessProxy::platformLoadTrackingPreventionContentRuleList):\n(WebKit::NetworkProcessProxy::platformObserveTrackingPreventionContentRuleListUpdates):\n* Source/WebKit/UIProcess/Network/NetworkProcessProxy.h:\n* Source/WebKit/UIProcess/Network/NetworkProcessProxyCocoa.mm:\n(WebKit::NetworkProcessProxy::platformLoadTrackingPreventionContentRuleList):\n(WebKit::NetworkProcessProxy::platformObserveTrackingPreventionContentRuleListUpdates):\n* Source/WebKit/UIProcess/WebProcessPool.cpp:\n(WebKit::WebProcessPool::pageBeginUsingWebsiteDataStore):\n* Source/WebKit/WebProcess/Network/WebLoaderStrategy.cpp:\n(WebKit::addParametersShared):\n* Tools/TestWebKitAPI/Tests/WebKit/WKWebView/ScriptTrackingPrivacyTests.mm:\n(TestWebKitAPI::makeTrackingPreventionContentRuleListHandler):\n(TestWebKitAPI::installTrackingPreventionContentRuleList):\n(TestWebKitAPI::TrackingPreventionContentRuleListSwizzler::TrackingPreventionContentRuleListSwizzler):\n(TestWebKitAPI::TrackingPreventionContentRuleListSwizzler::~TrackingPreventionContentRuleListSwizzler):\n(TestWebKitAPI::supportsTrackingPreventionContentRuleListRequests):\n(TestWebKitAPI::setUpWebViewForFingerprintingTests):\n(TestWebKitAPI::(ScriptTrackingPrivacyTests, SameSiteFetchNotBlocked)):\n(TestWebKitAPI::(ScriptTrackingPrivacyTests, MainFrameNavigationNotBlocked)):\n(TestWebKitAPI::(ScriptTrackingPrivacyTests, CrossSiteFetchBlocked)):\n(TestWebKitAPI::(ScriptTrackingPrivacyTests, CrossSiteFetchNotBlockedWhenResourceLoadStatisticsDisabled)):\n\nCanonical link: https://commits.webkit.org/321932@main",
      "github_url": "https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/172f52ace994d118941140e575139d76fcb06e14",
